Pitboard never performs or automates sign-in to a Claude or an OpenAI account, and never
makes a sign-in from a tool's login. Signing in to Claude Code or Codex happens through the
tool's own flow, run by you.

In the app's account windows, you sign in to claude.ai or chatgpt.com on the site's own
pages. Pitboard never reads, copies or changes the session that results. WebKit, the
system's web engine, keeps it on your computer in that account's website data, under
Pitboard's bundle identifier, as a browser keeps its own.
